{"seq":4,"slug":"productivity-deep-work","title":"效率与深度工作","stage":"DONE","category":"learning","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work","rating":{"composite":4.46,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":4.13,"verdict":"recommend","uScore":4.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"效率与深度工作-简介\">效率与深度工作 简介</h1><p>本手册面向希望系统性提升工作效率和专注力的程序员。无论你是刚入行的新人，还是拥有多年经验的资深工程师，日常工作中都会面临同样的挑战：无休止的会议、频繁的上下文切换、难以推进的技术债务、以及永远不够用的时间。这些问题的根源往往不是能力不足，而是缺乏一套经过验证的效率体系。</p>\n<p>你将在本手册中学到一整套从时间规划到精力管理的实践方法。这些方法并非纸上谈兵的理论，而是经过众多高效能工程师在真实工作场景中反复打磨的策略与工具。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>时间管理体系</strong>从最基础的时间分配入手，介绍时间盒方法、GTD 方法论、艾森豪威尔矩阵和日历工程四种经典工具，帮助你建立对时间的掌控感。第二章<strong>优先级框架</strong>教你如何在纷繁的任务中识别真正重要的事情，通过影响力-努力矩阵、个人 OKR、每周回顾和学会说&quot;不&quot;来保护你的核心精力。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>深度工作与专注</strong>是本手册的核心，深入讲解 Cal Newport 的深度工作理论、心流状态的触发与维持、注意力管理以及干扰消除策略，帮助你在碎片化的工作环境中找回长时间专注的能力。第四章<strong>个人工作流</strong>将这些理念落地为具体的工具和流程，涵盖任务管理工具选型、自动化与脚本、第二大脑系统搭建以及开发者日常节奏设计。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>自律与习惯</strong>关注行为层面的持续改进，包括习惯养成的科学框架、动力系统构建、拖延应对策略和问责机制，确保你能长期坚持高效的工作方式。第六章<strong>精力与恢复</strong>提醒你，效率的基础是充沛的精力，介绍超日节律、程序员运动方案、休息与恢复策略以及可持续高效的长期思维。</p>\n<p>推荐的学习路径是按照章节顺序依次阅读。如果你当前面临的主要问题是无法集中注意力，可以直接从第三章开始；如果你更关心如何建立日常工作系统，第四章是最佳起点。无论从哪里开始，建议最终完整阅读全部六章，因为效率是一个系统工程，每个环节都相互支撑。</p>\n<p>高效工作不是一种天赋，而是一种可以习得的技能。让我们开始这段从忙碌走向高效的旅程。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"time-management-systems","title":"时间管理体系","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/time-management-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"time-boxing","title":"时间盒方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/time-management-systems/time-boxing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gtd-method","title":"GTD 方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/time-management-systems/gtd-method"},{"seq":3,"slug":"eisenhower-matrix","title":"艾森豪威尔矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/time-management-systems/eisenhower-matrix"},{"seq":4,"slug":"calendar-engineering","title":"日历工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/time-management-systems/calendar-engineering"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"priority-frameworks","title":"优先级框架","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/priority-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"impact-effort-matrix","title":"影响力-努力矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/priority-frameworks/impact-effort-matrix"},{"seq":2,"slug":"okr-personal","title":"个人 OKR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/priority-frameworks/okr-personal"},{"seq":3,"slug":"weekly-review-ritual","title":"每周回顾仪式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/priority-frameworks/weekly-review-ritual"},{"seq":4,"slug":"saying-no","title":"说\"不\"的艺术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/priority-frameworks/saying-no"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"deep-work-and-focus","title":"深度工作与专注","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/deep-work-and-focus","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deep-work-principles","title":"深度工作原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/deep-work-and-focus/deep-work-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"flow-state-engineering","title":"心流状态工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/deep-work-and-focus/flow-state-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"attention-management","title":"注意力管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/deep-work-and-focus/attention-management"},{"seq":4,"slug":"distraction-elimination","title":"消除干扰","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/deep-work-and-focus/distraction-elimination"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"personal-workflow","title":"个人工作流","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/personal-workflow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"task-management-tools","title":"任务管理工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/productivity-deep-work/personal-workflow/task-manag